# Cererile pentru Laboratorul 6.
# In IntelliJ: apasati sageata verde din stanga fiecarei cereri.
# Dupa fiecare repornire a aplicatiei, datele revin la cele initiale.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Exercitiul 1 - Film valid
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Wicked",
  "genre": "Musical",
  "price": 30
}

### Exercitiul 1 - Film invalid: titlu gol, fara gen, pret negativ
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "price": -5
}

### Exercitiul 1 - Titlu prea lung (peste 40 de caractere)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Un titlu de film mult prea lung pentru cinematograful nostru",
  "genre": "Drama",
  "price": 30
}

### Exercitiul 1 - PUT doar cu pretul (in Laboratorul 5 stergea titlul!)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/movies/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 45
}

### Exercitiul 2 - Rezervare valida
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/movies/1/screenings/1/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clientName": "Ana Popescu",
  "phone": "0722123456",
  "seats": 2,
  "date": "2027-01-15"
}

### Exercitiul 2 - Rezervare invalida: nume scurt, telefon gresit, prea multe locuri, data in trecut
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/movies/1/screenings/1/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clientName": "Al",
  "phone": "123",
  "seats": 15,
  "date": "2025-01-01"
}

### Exercitiul 2 - Rezervare fara telefon (ce face @Pattern cu null?)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/movies/1/screenings/1/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clientName": "Ion Ionescu",
  "seats": 1,
  "date": "2027-01-15"
}

### Exercitiul 2 - Proiectia 3 nu mai are locuri (ce status primim?)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/movies/2/screenings/3/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clientName": "Maria Ionescu",
  "phone": "0733111222",
  "seats": 5,
  "date": "2027-01-15"
}

### Exercitiul 2 - Proiectie care nu exista (ce status primim?)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/movies/1/screenings/99/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clientName": "Maria Ionescu",
  "phone": "0733111222",
  "seats": 1,
  "date": "2027-01-15"
}

### Exercitiul 3 - Film care nu exista
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/movies/99

### Exercitiul 3 - Proiectiile unui film care nu exista
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/movies/99/screenings

